      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2002-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(6^{2002} = 2^{2002}\\cdot 3^{2002},\\) the ratio becomes \\[\\dfrac{2^{2001}\\cdot 3^{2003}}{2^{2002}\\cdot 3^{2002}} = \\dfrac{3}{2}.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
